## Final Recommendation  

The implementation of **`ProviderHealthService`** and its integration with the execution pipeline satisfies all listed evaluation criteria. The code correctly handles probe cooldown/back‑off, per‑provider concurrency, persisted reservation semantics, readiness vs capacity separation, configuration wiring, OpenRouter no‑harness behavior, truthful cost handling, evidence‑insufficient continuations, cancellation cleanup, health state transitions, OpenSpec integration, and shows low regression risk.

**Action:** No changes required. The change can be merged as‑is.  

